<section class="panel users-panel settings-users-panel" id="users"><div class="panel-heading users-panel-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">DIT TEAM</p><h2>Alle brugere <span class="count-badge"><%= users.length %></span></h2><p>Personer med adgang til Cibus-portalen.</p><p class="role-guide">Admin: administration · Normal: redigering · View: læseadgang</p></div><div class="users-panel-actions"><button class="button button-primary" type="button" data-open-modal>＋ Tilføj bruger</button><div class="search-wrap"><span>⌕</span><input type="search" placeholder="Søg efter bruger" aria-label="Søg efter bruger" data-user-search></div></div></div><div class="table-wrap"><table class="users-table"><thead><tr><th>PERSON</th><th>ROLLE</th><th>STATUS</th><th>OPRETTET</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><% users.forEach((person, index) => { %><tr data-user-row><td><div class="person-cell"><span class="mini-avatar avatar-tone-<%= index % 4 %>"><%= person.name.split(' ').map(part => part[0]).slice(0, 2).join('').toUpperCase() %></span><span><strong><%= person.name %></strong><small><%= person.email %></small></span></div></td><td><span class="role-pill <%= person.role %>"><%= roleNames[person.role] || 'Normal' %></span></td><td><span class="user-status <%= person.active ? 'active' : 'inactive' %>"><i></i><%= person.active ? 'Aktiv' : 'Deaktiveret' %></span></td><td class="date-cell"><%= new Date(person.created_at + 'Z').toLocaleDateString('da-DK', { day: 'numeric', month: 'short', year: 'numeric' }) %></td><td><div class="user-actions"><button class="row-action" type="button" data-edit-user data-action="/users/<%= person.id %>/update" data-name="<%= person.name %>" data-email="<%= person.email %>">Redigér</button><% if (person.id !== user.id) { %><form action="/users/<%= person.id %>/toggle" method="post"><button class="row-action" type="submit"><%= person.active ? 'Deaktivér' : 'Aktivér' %></button></form><% } else { %><span class="you-label">Dig</span><% } %></div></td></tr><% }) %></tbody></table><div class="empty-state search-empty" hidden>Ingen brugere matcher din søgning.</div></div></section>
<div class="modal-backdrop" data-modal hidden><section class="modal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="modal-title"><button class="modal-close" type="button" data-close-modal aria-label="Luk">×</button><span class="modal-icon">♙</span><p class="eyebrow">BYD EN NY KOLLEGA VELKOMMEN</p><h2 id="modal-title">Tilføj bruger</h2><p class="modal-description">Opret adgang til jeres arbejdsområde.</p><form action="/users" method="post" class="settings-form"><label for="new-name">Fulde navn</label><input id="new-name" name="name" autocomplete="name" required minlength="2" maxlength="80" placeholder="F.eks. Sofie Jensen"><label for="new-email">E-mailadresse</label><input id="new-email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required placeholder="sofie@forenede.dk"><label for="new-password">Midlertidig adgangskode</label><input id="new-password" name="password" type="password" minlength="12" maxlength="128" autocomplete="new-password" required placeholder="Mindst 12 tegn"><label for="new-role">Rolle</label><select id="new-role" name="role"><option value="user">Medarbejder</option><option value="admin">Administrator</option></select><button class="button button-primary modal-submit" type="submit">Opret bruger <span>→</span></button></form></section></div>
<div class="modal-backdrop" data-edit-modal hidden><section class="modal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="edit-modal-title"><button class="modal-close" type="button" data-close-edit-modal aria-label="Luk">×</button><span class="modal-icon">✎</span><p class="eyebrow">ADMINISTRATION</p><h2 id="edit-modal-title">Redigér bruger</h2><p class="modal-description">Ændr navn og login-e-mail. Brugeren logger ind med den nye e-mail fremover.</p><form method="post" class="settings-form" data-edit-form><label for="edit-name">Fulde navn</label><input id="edit-name" name="name" autocomplete="off" required minlength="2" maxlength="80"><label for="edit-email">E-mailadresse (login)</label><input id="edit-email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="off" required maxlength="120"><button class="button button-primary modal-submit" type="submit">Gem ændringer <span>→</span></button></form></section></div>
